>> title: Garam Masala
>> category: Spice Blends & Marinades
>> tags: indian, spice blend, toasted, pantry
>> servings: 24
>> time: 20 min
>> step.1: toast in a dry skillet 3 min
>> step.2: add, toast 1 min more
>> step.3: cool, grind fine
>> step.4: whisk in

Toast @coriander seeds{3%Tbs}(18 g), @cumin seeds{2%Tbs}(12 g), @black peppercorns{2%tsp}, @cloves{1%tsp}, and @green cardamom pods{2%tsp} in a dry #skillet{} over medium heat until fragrant, about ~{3%min}.

Add @cinnamon stick{1}(3-in piece, broken up) and @bay leaves{2} to @&(~1)toasted spices{} and toast ~{1%min} more.

Cool @&(~1)spices{} completely, then grind to a fine powder in a #spice grinder{}.

Whisk @freshly grated nutmeg{1/2%tsp} and @ground mace{1/4%tsp} into @&(~1)powder{}.
